<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts Millenium.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts Millenium.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Millenium Chemicals Inc to neutral from buy, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately trading after closing Monday at 20-7/8.</p>
</text>
